From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add DS sound

sdl_mixer.c plays the digitized sounds on hardware channels 0-5, which
do the resampling at their own rate, the volume and the positional
stereo, so SD_PrepareSound only converts the samples to signed in place.
A 700 Hz thread fills a stream on channel 6 with the music hook, which
sequences the AdLib music and sounds, and the PC speaker.
---
 id_sd.c         |  37 +------
 nds/SDL_mixer.h |  47 +++++++++
 nds/sdl_mixer.c | 268 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 319 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 nds/SDL_mixer.h
 create mode 100644 nds/sdl_mixer.c

